    <origin>Filed 2026-08-25 as "route every call site through the resolver". **Rewritten 2026-08-27** after the task escalated (`notes/task-076-callsite-inventory-and-ESCALATION.md`) and the owner chose **option (C)** over the escalation note's recommended (A). Rationale recorded in `notes/coordination-compose-r8-2026-08-27.md` AMENDMENT 2.</origin>
